    "detailed_description": "Trapped, Alone and long away from real world, a man must make his way through dangerous places to find a way out.<br><br>Deathwish is a top-down, single-player game power by UNREAL ENGINE 5 and developed by two developers<br><br>A man who has been time traveled by mysterious stone is trapped in medieval ages and have to find the stone in this age to get back to his real world<br>Along the way the man will face a lot of enemies and a lot more traps.<br><br>Run ,fight enemies, avoid the traps , solve riddles , choose the right path and think twice before it, because there is no more than one right path, find weapon if you need your way to be easier.<br>The game will take you on a medieval adventure with different environment in each level.<br>There is a big challenge playing Deathwish, the traps are unpredictable and one hit will get you killed, you have to be cautious and patient to beat the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129830/extras/a6d3b62222612df5baf1c0800567b09c.poster.avif?t=1694290652\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129830/extras/a6d3b62222612df5baf1c0800567b09c.webm?t=1694290652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129830/extras/a6d3b62222612df5baf1c0800567b09c.mp4?t=1694290652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>MODES:-</strong><br>-Story Mode<br>-Endless Running Mode",
